1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,180
On the way to Mars, help is up to 24 minutes away.

2
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:10,456
NeuroShield lets astronauts check their own health:
wearable sensors, vital signs and cabin data, color-coded
at a glance.

3
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:15,880
Explainable alerts warn minutes early, say exactly what to
do, and who leads when Earth is far.

4
00:00:15,980 --> 00:00:20,617
A timed daily routine with step-by-step help and rewards
keeps measurements on track.

5
00:00:20,720 --> 00:00:26,573
A personal logbook spots changes against each astronaut's
own baseline, built on real NASA data.

6
00:00:26,670 --> 00:00:28,918
NeuroShield: see it before you feel it.
